# Virtual environment is intentionally tracked in this repository.
# The auto-generated ignore-all rule has been removed so that
# the full venv can be committed to Git, ensuring reproducible
# dependency versions without extra installation steps.
#
# PyTorch (torch) is excluded because its CUDA/cuDNN DLLs exceed
# GitHub's 100 MB per-file limit (~4 GB total). After cloning,
# run the torch install command documented in the README.
**/torch/
**/torch-*.dist-info/
